  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut zucchini and capsicum into bite-sized pieces. Slice brown onion into wedges.\n• Place zucchini, capsicum and onion on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat, then roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cc848e7b2ec1b120a94/step-c3720100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a large saucepan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Stir in the butter, tomato paste and garlic seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add the water, stock powder and risoni. Bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to medium and cook until ‘al dente’, 7-8 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cc848e7b2ec1b120a94/step-58062a10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir roast veggies, baby spinach and Cheddar cheese through the risoni.\n• Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cc848e7b2ec1b120a94/step-1d69ee20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlicky roast veggie risoni between bowls.\n• Top with basil pesto to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cc848e7b2ec1b120a94/step-8e1bc230.jpg"
    }
  ]
